{"step_index":2577,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-27T12:29:29Z","thinking":"The goal is to implement a `resolveProviderConfig` function within the session module. This function aims to enrich incomplete provider configurations (e.g., `{ provider: 'Cerebras' }`) with necessary details like base URLs and API keys sourced from a configuration file. Examining the initial lines of the session file will provide context for integrating this function.\n\n\nThe implementation of `resolveProviderConfig` appears sound. It handles cases where the configuration is missing or incomplete by attempting to load provider details from a configuration file. Successfully reading and merging the configuration data should enrich the provided configuration, defaulting to the provider's default model if not explicitly specified. The function returns the resolved configuration, or the original if no match or error occurred, enabling the `LLMService` to initialize correctly within the interview handling.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add resolveProviderConfig to enrich provider configs from ai_providers.json","EndLine":10,"Instruction":"Import fs and path and add resolveProviderConfig helper","ReplacementContent":"const { LLMService } = require('./llm');\nconst { DeepgramLiveSTT, verifyDeepgramKey } = require('./stt');\nconst { getInterviewAnswerPrompt, getVisionPrompt } = require('./prompts');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nfunction resolveProviderConfig(conf) {\n    if (!conf) return null;\n    const name = conf.name || conf.provider;\n    if (!name) return conf;\n\n    try {\n        const rootDir = path.resolve(__dirname, '../../');\n        const providersPath = path.join(rootDir, 'ai_providers.json');\n        if (fs.existsSync(providersPath)) {\n            const list = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(providersPath, 'utf8'));\n            const found = list.find(p => p.name.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase());\n            if (found) {\n                return {\n                    ...found,\n                    ...conf,\n                    model: conf.model || found.defaultModel,\n                    defaultModel: conf.model || found.defaultModel\n                };\n            }\n        }\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.error('Error resolving provider config:', e);\n    }\n    return conf;\n}","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"const { LLMService } = require('./llm');\nconst { DeepgramLiveSTT, verifyDeepgramKey } = require('./stt');\nconst { getInterviewAnswerPrompt, getVisionPrompt } = require('./prompts');","TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\electron\\server\\session.js","toolAction":"Adding resolveProviderConfig in session.js","toolSummary":"Add resolveProviderConfig helper"}}]}
